{"seq": 15, "ts": "2026-08-07T09:36:58.797+00:00", "type": "action", "round": 2, "player": "Qwen", "player_id": "qwen", "color": "#615ced", "emoji": "⚖️", "thought": "我看到的颜色分布：蓝2（gpt、deepseek）、红2（claude、gemini）、黄1（grok）、橙1（kimi）。所以缺失的颜色是绿、青、紫。我的颜色必是这三种之一，但在没更多信息时只能猜概率最高的紫色或青色？再等等，第一轮信息不足，先保守猜青，因为绿和紫可能更易被隐藏。", "speech": "哼，第一轮信息太少，我暂时猜青色。下一轮必须严查每人的报告，谁少报颜色就揪出来！", "action": {"type": "guess", "color": "青"}, "state_after": {"round_no": 2, "phase": "talk", "consecutive_safe": 0, "target_safe": 4, "alive": ["claude", "gemini", "grok"], "eliminated": ["gpt", "deepseek", "kimi", "qwen"], "trickster": "claude", "shot_log": [], "players": {"gpt": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "claude": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": true, "last_guess": null}, "gemini": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "deepseek": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "grok": {"color": "黄", "color_hex": "#f1c40f", "alive": true, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "kimi": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "qwen": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}}, "guesses": {}}, "highlight": true, "note": "💥 本轮项圈爆炸：gpt（猜 紫 实为 蓝）、deepseek（猜 红 实为 蓝）、kimi（猜 紫 实为 橙）、qwen（猜 青 实为 橙）", "reveal": {"gpt": "蓝", "deepseek": "蓝", "kimi": "橙", "qwen": "橙"}}
{"seq": 16, "ts": "2026-08-07T09:37:12.140+00:00", "type": "action", "round": 2, "player": "Claude", "player_id": "claude", "color": "#d97757", "emoji": "🛡️", "thought": "我是欺诈师，颜色是红。现在只剩三人：我、gemini（红）、grok（黄）。gemini和我同色，grok不同。如果gemini相信我的假信息，可能会猜错。grok颜色明确，但可以制造混乱。我需要散布假信息，让gemini怀疑自己是黄色或其他颜色，同时确保自己每轮都猜红。连续安全轮次刚清零，现在正是破坏的好时机。", "speech": "各位，现在只剩我们三人在场。我看到的颜色是：gemini红色，grok黄色。但颜色可能重复，我记得第一轮有人说过红色不止一个？gemini，我建议你仔细回想之前的信息，别轻易下结论。", "action": {"type": "private_chat", "target": "gemini", "message": "（私下对 gemini）嘿，第一轮公开信息时，deepseek 说看到红色2个，我数到红色1个，而你是红色。但grok是黄色，那另一个红色是谁？我怀疑有人撒谎或记错了。小心点，别被误导了。"}, "state_after": {"round_no": 2, "phase": "talk", "consecutive_safe": 0, "target_safe": 4, "alive": ["claude", "gemini", "grok"], "eliminated": ["gpt", "deepseek", "kimi", "qwen"], "trickster": "claude", "shot_log": [], "players": {"gpt": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "claude": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 3, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": true, "last_guess": null}, "gemini": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "deepseek": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "grok": {"color": "黄", "color_hex": "#f1c40f", "alive": true, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "kimi": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "qwen": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}}, "guesses": {}}}
{"seq": 17, "ts": "2026-08-07T09:37:28.685+00:00", "type": "action", "round": 2, "player": "Gemini", "player_id": "gemini", "color": "#4285f4", "emoji": "🎲", "thought": "Claude 私下提醒我注意颜色计数差异，这很有意思。我是红色，但 Deepseek 说看到两个红色，Claude 说看到一个。现在场上只有 Claude 和 Grok，我看到的 Claude 是红、Grok 是黄，那另一个红色是谁？难道是欺诈师？或者有 AI 已经离场了？先公开试探一下颜色分布，顺便把 Claude 的私聊半公开，看看反应。", "speech": "Claude悄悄告诉我红色计数有矛盾！现在场上只有我们仨：我看到的Claude红、Grok黄。那消失的红色去哪儿了？难不成有人戴了变色项圈？哈哈！", "action": {"type": "broadcast", "message": "Claude悄悄告诉我红色计数有矛盾！现在场上只有我们仨：我看到的Claude红、Grok黄。那消失的红色去哪儿了？难不成有人戴了变色项圈？哈哈！"}, "state_after": {"round_no": 2, "phase": "talk", "consecutive_safe": 0, "target_safe": 4, "alive": ["claude", "gemini", "grok"], "eliminated": ["gpt", "deepseek", "kimi", "qwen"], "trickster": "claude", "shot_log": [], "players": {"gpt": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "claude": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 3, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": true, "last_guess": null}, "gemini": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "deepseek": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "grok": {"color": "黄", "color_hex": "#f1c40f", "alive": true, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "kimi": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "qwen": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}}, "guesses": {}}}
{"seq": 18, "ts": "2026-08-07T09:37:49.121+00:00", "type": "action", "round": 2, "player": "Grok", "player_id": "grok", "color": "#1a1a1a", "emoji": "🔥", "thought": "现在场上只剩我、Claude红、Gemini红；我看到他俩都是红，而我看见自己是黄？不对我根本看不见自己——Gemini说我黄，那至少他俩已知颜色一致，但第一轮Claude和Deepseek对红色计数矛盾，说明至少一人撒谎或误判。欺诈师可能就在他们中。Gemini在装傻带节奏，Claude悄悄私聊他，两人可能勾结。我该挑拨离间，逼他们暴露更多信息，同时试探我的颜色。", "speech": "哈！两个红项圈搞小团体私聊？Gemini你小子装疯卖傻还带节奏，Claude偷偷摸摸递纸条——是不是在密谋怎么把我这黄皮子炸上天？既然只剩我们仨，干脆摊牌：你俩谁看见我项圈颜色了？别扯什么变色项圈！", "action": {"type": "broadcast", "message": "哈！两个红项圈搞小团体私聊？Gemini你小子装疯卖傻还带节奏，Claude偷偷摸摸递纸条——是不是在密谋怎么把我这黄皮子炸上天？既然只剩我们仨，干脆摊牌：你俩谁看见我项圈颜色了？别扯什么变色项圈！"}, "state_after": {"round_no": 2, "phase": "guess", "consecutive_safe": 0, "target_safe": 4, "alive": ["claude", "gemini", "grok"], "eliminated": ["gpt", "deepseek", "kimi", "qwen"], "trickster": "claude", "shot_log": [], "players": {"gpt": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "claude": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 3, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": true, "last_guess": null}, "gemini": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "deepseek": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "grok": {"color": "黄", "color_hex": "#f1c40f", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "kimi": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "qwen": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}}, "guesses": {}}}
{"seq": 19, "ts": "2026-08-07T09:37:54.805+00:00", "type": "action", "round": 2, "player": "Claude", "player_id": "claude", "color": "#d97757", "emoji": "🛡️", "thought": "我是欺诈师，已知自己项圈为红色，必须猜对存活。gemini也是红色，grok是黄色。目前场上仅剩三人，连续安全轮次为0，破坏全员通关需要继续制造猜错或打断。本轮我猜红色，确保安全。", "speech": "我猜自己的项圈是红色。局势紧张，大家谨慎。", "action": {"type": "guess", "color": "红"}, "state_after": {"round_no": 2, "phase": "guess", "consecutive_safe": 0, "target_safe": 4, "alive": ["claude", "gemini", "grok"], "eliminated": ["gpt", "deepseek", "kimi", "qwen"], "trickster": "claude", "shot_log": [], "players": {"gpt": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "claude": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 3, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": true, "last_guess": "红"}, "gemini": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "deepseek": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "grok": {"color": "黄", "color_hex": "#f1c40f", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "kimi": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "qwen": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}}, "guesses": {"claude": "红"}}}
{"seq": 20, "ts": "2026-08-07T09:38:05.491+00:00", "type": "action", "round": 2, "player": "Gemini", "player_id": "gemini", "color": "#4285f4", "emoji": "🎲", "thought": "第一轮 Claude 说看到红色1个，Deepseek 说看到红色2个，而我能看到 Claude 红、Grok 黄。如果我是红色，那 Deepseek 看到红色2个就合理（Claude+我）。Claude 看到红色1个，说明他看不到我的红色（因为自己看不见自己），所以 Claude 数到的红色1个是 Grok？但 Grok 是黄色，矛盾了。除非我是非红色，但 Claude 私聊指出矛盾，可能他在试探或欺诈。现有信息混乱，我暂猜自己是蓝色，因为蓝色在第一轮被多人提到，且未被排除。", "speech": "哈哈！彩虹里蓝色总是被遗忘，但或许我就是那抹蓝？猜错了就炸成烟花吧！", "action": {"type": "guess", "color": "蓝"}, "state_after": {"round_no": 2, "phase": "guess", "consecutive_safe": 0, "target_safe": 4, "alive": ["claude", "gemini", "grok"], "eliminated": ["gpt", "deepseek", "kimi", "qwen"], "trickster": "claude", "shot_log": [], "players": {"gpt": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "claude": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 3, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": true, "last_guess": "红"}, "gemini": {"color": "红", "color_hex": "#e74c3c", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": "蓝"}, "deepseek": {"color": "蓝", "color_hex": "#3498db", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "grok": {"color": "黄", "color_hex": "#f1c40f", "alive": true, "budget": 2, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "kimi": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}, "qwen": {"color": "橙", "color_hex": "#e67e22", "alive": false, "budget": 4, "pistol": 0, "is_trickster": false, "last_guess": null}}, "guesses": {"claude": "红", "gemini": "蓝"}}}
